DM fails in `HandlePDUSessionSMContextCreate`, the handler returns without writing a response. The SMContext is already registered in the pool at that point, so it is never released (with its canonical ref), and the AMF gets an empty `200` with no `smContextRef`, so it cannot release it either.\n\nThis sends the path through `makeEstRejectResAndReleaseSMContext`, like the other failures after the context is created (e.g. the DNN mismatch just above): the AMF gets `504 NETWORK_FAILURE` with a PDU Session Establishment Reject (5GSM cause \"network failure\"), and the SMContext is removed.\n\nThe new test makes the token fetch fail and checks the response status and that the SMContext is gone from the pool; it fails on main.\n\nNote: #239 changes the same `GetTokenCtx` call. If it lands first I'll rebase; the fix here is 3 lines.\n\nFixes free5gc/free5gc#1176\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/smf/issues/244/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/smf/issues/244/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"maringantis","id":27370703,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MzcwNzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27370703?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maringantis","html_url":"https://github.com/maringantis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maringantis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maringantis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maringantis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maringantis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maringantis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maringantis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maringantis/repos","events_url":"https://api